  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Tea Production by Harvesting and the Establishment of Tea Nurseries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Tea.Beneficiaries: 4140 (1791 women).Description: The group seeks to increase production and improve the quality of their tea through development of 214 hectares of land for tea cultivation, establishment of a nursery to supply new farmers with seedlings, acquire two trucks to improve the timeliness of delivery of tea to the factory, construct 9 additional collection sheds and provide additional training to farmers on best tea farming practices.</narrative>
  </description>
